{"version":1,"content":"<p>任天堂經典遊戲《塞爾達傳説：時之笛》重製版在Nintendo Switch 2平台取得了驚人的開局。遊戲全球發售僅四天，銷量便突破520萬份，成為目前Switch 2平台首發銷售速度最快的任天堂自家發行遊戲。這一成績不僅刷新了系列多款作品的銷售紀錄，也讓任天堂在年末假日銷售季獲得了一款重要的市場主力作品。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586290.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:21:56.829346+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T13:13:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_hash":"f32deffa5bec971ecd0cb6c9e1854699c20fda6295f85bb34db88514a6559e68","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}